---
title: "invest (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_cancelled: investor invokes invest(amount, saftSignature)
    q_check_cancelled --> q_revert_cancel: sale is cancelled
    q_revert_cancel --> [*]: revert SaleCancelled
    q_check_cancelled --> q_check_ended: sale is active
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_ended: sale has ended
    q_revert_ended --> [*]: revert SaleEnded
    q_check_ended --> q_verify_saft: sale not ended
    q_verify_saft --> q_revert_saft: SAFT signature verification fails
    q_revert_saft --> [*]: revert InvalidSAFTSignature
    q_verify_saft --> q_check_min: SAFT signature valid
    q_check_min --> q_revert_min: amount < minimumInvestAmount
    q_revert_min --> [*]: revert BelowMinimumInvestment
    q_check_min --> q_transfer: amount >= minimumInvestAmount
    q_transfer --> q_update: transferFrom(investor, address(this), amount)
    q_update --> q_record_time: position.totalInvested += amount; totalCapitalInvested += amount
    q_record_time --> [*]: position.lastInvestTimestamp = block.timestamp; emit Invested(investor, amount)

    note right of q_verify_saft
        INV-001: Only investors with signed SAFT documents can participate
        INV-002: SAFT signature proves cryptographic authorization
    end note

    note right of q_record_time
        INV-003: lastInvestTimestamp used to calculate per-investor refund window
        INV-004: No predetermined end time; sale runs until manually ended
    end note
